 "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Grades live only in the gradebook; the plugin has no grade table; visibility via the gradebook's hidden-grade settings (grade_grade::is_hidden()); no custom release mechanism; advanced grading/outcomes not in v1.", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_grade_update", "label": "grade_update()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_module_grade_callbacks", "label": "reflectjournal grade module callbacks (*_grade_item_update, *_update_grades, *_grade_item_delete, *_rescale_activity_grades)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_custom_completion", "label": "Custom completion rule completionsubmit", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "classes/completion/custom_completion.php extends core_completion\\activity_custom_completion; rule is 'entry row exists'; v1 has no delete-entry action so completion, once earned, cannot regress.", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_deadline_lock", "label": "Deadline lock (entry form read-only after deadline)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Entry form read-only once time() is past deadline; feedback and grading unaffected (teachers exempt); deadline = 0 means no lock, no calendar event, no dates.", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_no_draft_state", "label": "No draft state (row exists = submitted)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "No status column: an entry row exists means submitted; timecreated is the submission time; keeps 'completion once earned, stays' true.", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_activity_dates", "label": "mod_reflectjournal\\dates (activity dates class)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_calendar_event_integration", "label": "Calendar event integration for the deadline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_submissions_list", "label": "Submissions list (from enrolled users, core table API)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Built from get_enrolled_users with the submit capability, not from entry rows, so a learner with no entry can be graded; core flexible_table/sql_table gives paging and sorting.", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_privacy_provider_scope", "label": "Privacy provider scope", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_backup_restore_scope", "label": "Backup/restore scope", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_future_external_web_service", "label": "Future: external web service (core_external)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "db